<title>USA: KEY IMM CURRENCY FUTURES CLOSE HIGHER.</title>
<headline>KEY IMM CURRENCY FUTURES CLOSE HIGHER.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 7 - Key IMM currency futures closed higher, and are expected to grind higher in the near term. Traders said Sept marks are especially due for a correction. Sept marks seen rising to $0.5442 or 1.8420 in the medium term. Sell-off in pesos continued, while sterling clung to losses. ((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
